# The build context is the repository root. The kit carries the tree of the tag it was built from, minus
# what is not source: version control, local build output, caches and anything a working copy minted.
# (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore; the legacy builder ignores this file and sends everything.)
.git
build/
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/node_modules
**/.venv
charts/*/charts/
charts/*/tmpcharts-*/
*.tgz
*.log
.DS_Store
secrets/
pub-sealed-secrets.pem
sealed-secrets-key.backup.yaml
tockmox-site/
tockmox.yaml
